sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as Laravel API
    participant DB as Database
    U->>F: Enter e-mail + password
    F->>A: GET /api/csrf-cookie (XSRF-TOKEN cookie)
    A-->>F: 204 + CSRF cookie
    F->>A: POST /api/auth/login (X-XSRF-TOKEN)
    A->>A: Rate limiter (5 attempts / 60 s per-account lockout)
    A->>DB: Auth::attempt(email, password) - verify bcrypt hash
    alt valid credentials
        A->>A: Regenerate the session
        A->>DB: audit auth.admin_login (if admin)
        A-->>F: 200 { user }
    else invalid
        A->>DB: audit auth.login_failed
        A-->>F: 401 Invalid email or password
    end
